pe":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてくれるかしら、、🥕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまーにメンバーのブログ見たりするのだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日一番上にあったのがふーちゃんのブログで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしも今日マネージャーさんに体温報告するの忘れていて同じだーとなりました。それだけ。🌱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さまは日々何をして過ごしていますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊急事態宣言が延長してしまいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しの我慢です、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手洗いうがいも忘れずしっかりしてね😶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡邉理佐"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-keya-31873":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。欅坂46の関有美子です🐱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/e45/b795b2f3fdf4113e81e45b07e4dcd.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやかけで富士急ロケが放送されましたね〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の回がお化け屋敷の回みたいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんからFUJIYAMA面白かったよ〜って言われました(笑)"},{"type":"brea